{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act33side_level_act33side_09_beg",
  "groupId": "act33side",
  "stageId": "act33side_09",
  "title": "尘埃落定",
  "storyCode": "BB-9",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act33side/level_act33side_09_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "76cf95fdc93df9e12d87f8992d392dc05c567ff73e03786fb8359cb9a3cff78d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_desert_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡兹戴尔地区，巴别塔罗德岛本舰外"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "决然的刺客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "巴别塔并无防备，如摄政王所料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谨慎的刺客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "减少动静，提高警惕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谨慎的刺客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按原定路线进入，找到魔王。A路线和B路线同样待命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "决然的刺客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "核心战力不存在于这艘船上。他们撤回支援需要时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "决然的刺客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "巴别塔的护卫也依旧没有反应过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谨慎的刺客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......摄政王殿下赌对了。有敌方的大人物在帮我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谨慎的刺客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "全队，即刻登舰。速战速决，减少意外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "十分钟前，阿米娅被一阵奇怪的噪音吵醒。\n巴别塔一直没有停止过维修和翻新，与她刚来到这个新家时相比，这里已经发生了很大变化。\n“也许是可露希尔小姐又在忙前忙后了？”\n在阿米娅的房间里，博士为她留下了很多绘本，上面画着她闻所未闻的故事。\n她最喜欢的一本，讲述的是一个乘着奇异载具自天空坠向地面的人所经历的冒险。\n但她并不喜欢它的结局，那人最终还是修好了载具，要与地上的孩子告别，回到天空。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好讨厌的声音，博士还没来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特蕾西娅小姐......只好去找特蕾西娅小姐了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唐宁叔叔，您好！您的钳子掉在地上了，给！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴别塔成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1308_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢阿米娅。你要去哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去议长室找特蕾西娅小姐。对了，您有看到博士吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴别塔成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1308_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士？这几天好像一直没见过，应该是在指挥室指挥作战吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，果然博士还是很忙......再见！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴别塔成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1308_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米娅，跑慢点！舰船上很多地方还在检修呢，别绊着了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴别塔成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1308_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这孩子真是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴别塔成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1308_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谨慎的刺客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "解决一个，继续走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "决然的刺客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "内应已经埋伏在各处待命，随时可以配合我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "决然的刺客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "遇到其他人直接动手，舰上剩下的人都没有威胁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "49_g10_theresaoffice"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特蕾西娅小姐，我带来了我的故事书——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸......为什么门关着？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特蕾西娅小姐，是我！您在里面吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "可露希尔小姐教过我，这样也可以开门......\n开了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特蕾西娅小姐——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米娅，为什么你会在这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我听到了讨厌的声音，离我很近......我有点害怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们马上就能回家了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您看起来很累......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那阿米娅想陪着我一起工作吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是......故事书？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原来如此。如果是陪阿米娅，我稍微偷偷懒，博士和凯尔希医生一定不会说什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢特蕾西娅小姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来，坐在这里。等我们讲完这个故事，就能带阿米娅一起去我的家里玩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么，上次我们的故事讲到哪里了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_laccolith"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孽茨雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_420_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孽茨雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_420_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "杜卡雷，你该离远点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孽茨雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_420_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的身上全是庸人的血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜卡雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是顺手净化了些妄议此事的子裔罢了。无人该在此刻轻言那对兄妹的生死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜卡雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大不敬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜卡雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "孽茨雷，你此刻不应该退守城内吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孽茨雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_420_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那与我所等待的战争无关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜卡雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特雷西斯让你来确保她的死亡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孽茨雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_420_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你何尝不是在轻蔑那对兄妹？摄政王不会做这种安排。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孽茨雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_420_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是来此见证一场战争的结束，以及另一场战争的开始。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孽茨雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_420_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "若魔王败亡，我将背负这片刻的死亡气息......代王见证，我于深渊中握住的胜利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜卡雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......原来你还会感受到悲伤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孽茨雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_420_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "彼此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "34_g2_reedmarshes"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "芦苇编织的草环沉入了河底，阴郁的雾气已经连续多日未散。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈玛莲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哀珐尼尔......你是否还在她的身边？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈玛莲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1071_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "挽歌又要为谁而鸣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "49_g10_theresaoffice"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特蕾西娅小姐，您为什么停下了，故事才刚刚到要紧的地方呀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米娅，我想为你留下一点小小的悬念。让我换一种更舒服的方式给你讲故事好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可......嗯，好吧，听您的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米娅，小心点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "泡泡！欸，这是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "融合的黑色波纹不断在纯白的房间中荡漾，阿米娅好像一头扎进了黑色的泳池中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "黑色的泡泡隔绝了声音，也隔绝了阿米娅的视线。\n透过泡泡看去，特蕾西娅的身形越来越模糊......\n越来越遥远......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特蕾西娅......小姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先留在里面安稳地睡一觉吧，阿米娅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......待在我身边，是安全的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "决然的刺客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特蕾西娅殿下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "决然的刺客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们会用性命向您证明将军所追求的未来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我只是在叹息另一件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其实，您的遮掩在我的面前并没有意义。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我依然记得您当年在以勒什车辇前领命的样子，您在那一战中的英勇令我动容。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有与您一起的人，他们中的大多数我都记得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都是配得上被称为勇士的人。与此刻在卡兹戴尔城内奋战的英雄相比，也毫不逊色。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "决然的刺客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......并非为了掩饰身份，我们知道这在您面前毫无意义。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "决然的刺客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "割去双角，舍弃名姓，甚至毁掉身上每一寸可被当作特征的肌肤，只是因为当我们决定用如此低劣的手段屠戮魔王后——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "决然的刺客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们不配被萨卡兹记住。不能被记住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "决然的刺客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "动手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "涌动的气流如同泥沼般包裹住了不断向前突刺的数道刀锋。\n嗡——\n刀刃的震颤牵动着周遭空间的共鸣。不停逼近，不断刺破。\n随即利刃的主人们仿佛被无法抗拒的浪潮推向后方，被淹没。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我记得你们的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卢卡......我记得你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当年你独自拖住蒸汽骑士，在蒸汽的掩盖下扯出了那位骑士，并当众将其斩首......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "刺客的生命在消逝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我也记得你。镰须。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "千万同名萨卡兹中最特殊的一位，被俘虏后从高塔术师的营地中救下了三位同胞，还摧毁了他们的法阵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "49_g10_theresaoffice"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "死亡，也无法阻止他们靠近特蕾西娅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有你......莱文。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你为特雷西斯阻挡弓弩，失去了一臂，但在地狱里活下来并一直坚持到撤退......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我并不希望你们作为无名之徒死去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至少......我记得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "49_g10_theresaoffice"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "身边堆积的尸体越来越多，她所能立足的位置也越来越少。\n一声叹息。她拭去了脖颈处渗出的鲜血，不小心在白衣上蹭上一抹殷红。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "决然的刺客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们想在死前为萨卡兹再做些什么，才走到您的面前......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "决然的刺客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来杀死您——我们曾宣誓效忠的魔王。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "决然的刺客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1307_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您的强大我们比谁都清楚。那么，就让我们这些该死的叛徒，与您共赴地狱吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
